        <mxCell id="6nbgZos7-F4tN6DsKfS--88" value="To create This table you have to&lt;br&gt;iterate through all Paxes, and check for all related Bundles, Baggage, Seat, Meal&lt;br&gt;Meal takes records in DB according to the number of legs it comes&lt;br&gt;Meal is per leg per pax&lt;br&gt;Seat takes records in DB according to the number of legs it comes&lt;br&gt;Seat is per leg per pax&lt;br&gt;Each seat or meal per leg is differntiated based on legOrder attribute" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
